---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="HeapDeck.com — Tu memoria externa para desarrollo. Gratis siempre, Pro con IA $5/mes" 
  description="Guardá repos, CLIs, snippets y atajos. HeapDeck es gratis para siempre con todas las funciones centrales — sumá acciones puntuales de IA por $5/mes."
  lang="es"
>
  <!-- Navigation Header -->
  <header class="border-b-3 border-ink bg-bg-card sticky top-0 z-50">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="bg-accent-yellow border-2 border-ink p-1.5 shadow-hard-sm">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-ink"><path d="M4 3h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v6a10 10 0 0 1-10 10A10 10 0 0 1 2 11V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"/><polyline points="8 10 12 14 16 10"/></svg>
        </div>
        <a href="/es" class="font-display font-black text-2xl uppercase tracking-wider text-ink">
          HeapDeck<span class="text-accent-pink">.com</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <nav class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 font-mono text-sm font-bold">
        <a href="https://heapdeck.com/register" class="hover:text-accent-pink transition-colors">Probar la beta</a>
        <a href="#features" class="hover:text-accent-pink transition-colors">Funciones</a>
        <a href="#ai" class="hover:text-accent-pink transition-colors">IA</a>
        <a href="#pricing" class="hover:text-accent-pink transition-colors">Precios</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/tiagofur/heapdeck#readme" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hover:text-accent-pink transition-colors">Docs</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/tiagofur/heapdeck/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hover:text-accent-pink transition-colors">Changelog</a>
        <a href="/" class="border-2 border-ink px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-bg-primary hover:bg-accent-yellow shadow-hard-sm transition-all flex items-center gap-1">
          EN <span>🇺🇸</span>
        </a>
      </nav>
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <a 
          href="#pricing" 
          class="border-3 border-ink bg-accent-lime px-4 py-2 font-display font-black uppercase text-sm shadow-hard hover:-translate-x-0.5 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-hard-lg transition-all"
        >
          Gratis / Pro $5
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-block border-2 border-ink bg-accent-lavender text-xs font-mono font-black uppercase px-3 py-1.5 shadow-hard-sm">
        Gratis para siempre · Pro con IA $5/mes
      </div>
      
      <h1 class="font-display font-black text-4xl sm:text-6xl uppercase tracking-tight leading-none text-ink">
        Tu memoria externa para desarrollo, <span class="bg-accent-yellow border-b-5 border-ink px-1">gratis siempre</span>.
      </h1>
      
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p class="font-mono text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-ink leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
          Guardá repos, CLIs, plugins, atajos, prompts y workflows. Sin IA, sin costo, sin límites.
        </p>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-ink-soft leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
          Y si querés IA, es puntual: acciones concretas dentro de tu flujo por $5/mes. Sin chatbot — eso ya lo tenés en todos lados.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 pt-4">
        <a
          href="https://heapdeck.com/register"
          class="border-3 border-ink bg-accent-pink text-center px-6 py-4 font-display font-black uppercase text-lg shadow-hard hover:-translate-x-0.5 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-hard-lg transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
        >
          Probar la beta — gratis
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/tiagofur/heapdeck/releases"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="border-3 border-ink bg-bg-card text-center px-6 py-4 font-display font-black uppercase text-lg shadow-hard hover:-translate-x-0.5 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-hard-lg transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
        >
          Descargar para Desktop
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 3h6v6"/><path d="M10 14 21 3"/><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-ink-soft">
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent-yellow"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
          Beta viva — sin instalar nada
        </span>
        <span class="text-ink/30">•</span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent-pink"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
          Privacy-First
        </span>
        <span class="text-ink/30">•</span>
        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-danger"><path d="M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z"/></svg>
          100% Gratis, sin IA obligatoria
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
      <div class="bg-bg-card border-5 border-ink p-4 shadow-hard-xl rotate-1 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-300">
        <div class="border-3 border-ink bg-bg-elevated p-4 font-mono text-xs space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b-2 border-ink border-dashed pb-2">
            <span class="font-bold uppercase text-[10px] bg-accent-yellow px-1.5 border border-ink text-ink">heapdeck-brain-v1</span>
            <span class="text-ink-soft">Capture: OK</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-bg-primary border-2 border-ink p-3 space-y-2">
            <div class="font-bold text-accent-pink">type: repo</div>
            <div class="font-bold uppercase text-sm">chubin/cheat.sh</div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-soft leading-normal">
              Acceso unificado a los mejores repositorios de cheatsheets de la comunidad global.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-bg-primary border-2 border-ink p-3 space-y-2">
            <div class="font-bold text-accent-lime">type: cli</div>
            <div class="font-bold uppercase text-sm">fzf</div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-ink-soft leading-normal">
              Buscador difuso interactivo para la terminal. Extremadamente rápido.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- El Dolor Section -->
  <section class="border-y-3 border-ink bg-bg-card py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-8">
      <h2 class="font-display font-black text-3xl sm:text-4xl uppercase text-center text-ink">
        ¿Cuántas veces te pasó esto?
      </h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 font-mono text-sm">
        <div class="border-2 border-ink p-4 bg-bg-primary shadow-hard-sm space-y-2">
          <div class="text-xl">🔍</div>
          <p class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">
            Alguien te recomendó un CLI excelente. Lo guardaste "para después". Tres semanas después, no lo encontrás.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-2 border-ink p-4 bg-bg-primary shadow-hard-sm space-y-2">
          <div class="text-xl">🔌</div>
          <p class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">
            Instalaste un plugin de VS Code que te cambió la vida. No recordás cuál era ni por qué lo instalaste.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-2 border-ink p-4 bg-bg-primary shadow-hard-sm space-y-2">
          <div class="text-xl">⌨️</div>
          <p class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">
            Encontraste el atajo de macOS perfecto para algo que hacés 20 veces al día. Nunca lo internalizaste.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-2 border-ink p-4 bg-bg-primary shadow-hard-sm space-y-2">
          <div class="text-xl">🤖</div>
          <p class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">
            Generaste un prompt de AI coding que funcionó perfecto. No lo anotaste en ningún lado.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-2 border-ink p-4 bg-bg-primary shadow-hard-sm md:col-span-2 space-y-2">
          <div class="text-xl">💻</div>
          <p class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">
            Tenés el setup de tu stack preferido en algún README o Notion. Cada vez que lo necesitás, tardás 15 minutos en encontrarlo.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <p class="font-display font-black text-xl text-center uppercase tracking-wider text-accent-pink pt-4">
        HeapDeck es el lugar donde esas cosas dejan de perderse.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features Grid Section -->
  <section id="features" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 space-y-12 scroll-mt-20">
    <div class="text-center space-y-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-display font-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl uppercase tracking-tight text-ink">
        No solo repos. Todo lo útil para desarrollar.
      </h2>
      <p class="font-mono text-sm text-ink-soft">
        Guardá atajos, comandos y configuraciones — gratis para siempre. La IA es un opcional de $5/mes.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 font-mono text-xs">
      <div class="border-2 border-ink p-4 bg-bg-card shadow-hard-sm flex gap-3 items-start">
        <span class="text-lg bg-accent-yellow border border-ink p-1">📦</span>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-display font-black text-base uppercase mb-1">Repos</h4>
          <p class="text-ink-soft">GitHub repos de tools, libs, boilerplates</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="border-2 border-ink p-4 bg-bg-card shadow-hard-sm flex gap-3 items-start">
        <span class="text-lg bg-accent-pink border border-ink p-1">⚡</span>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-display font-black text-base uppercase mb-1">CLIs</h4>
          <p class="text-ink-soft">gh, jq, fzf, ripgrep, lazygit, comandos útiles</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="border-2 border-ink p-4 bg-bg-card shadow-hard-sm flex gap-3 items-start">
        <span class="text-lg bg-accent-lime border border-ink p-1">🔌</span>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-display font-black text-base uppercase mb-1">Plugins</h4>
          <p class="text-ink-soft">Extensiones de VS Code, JetBrains, Neovim</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="border-2 border-ink p-4 bg-bg-card shadow-hard-sm flex gap-3 items-start">
        <span class="text-lg bg-accent-lavender border border-ink p-1">⌨️</span>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-display font-black text-base uppercase mb-1">Atajos</h4>
          <p class="text-ink-soft">Atajos de teclado de tu OS, IDE o herramientas</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="border-2 border-ink p-4 bg-bg-card shadow-hard-sm flex gap-3 items-start">
        <span class="text-lg bg-accent-orange border border-ink p-1">🤖</span>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-display font-black text-base uppercase mb-1">Prompts</h4>
          <p class="text-ink-soft">Prompts de Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, Copilot</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="border-2 border-ink p-4 bg-bg-card shadow-hard-sm flex gap-3 items-start">
        <span class="text-lg bg-accent-cyan border border-ink p-1">📝</span>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-display font-black text-base uppercase mb-1">Snippets</h4>
          <p class="text-ink-soft">Gists, fragmentos de código, configs, alias</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- AI Features Section (Pro) -->
  <section id="ai" class="border-y-3 border-ink bg-bg-elevated scroll-mt-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 space-y-12">
      <div class="text-center space-y-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <div class="inline-block border-2 border-ink bg-ink text-bg-primary text-xs font-mono font-black uppercase px-3 py-1.5 shadow-hard-sm">
          HeapDeck Pro · $5/mes
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl uppercase tracking-tight text-ink">
          IA Pro: acciones puntuales, no otro chatbot.
        </h2>
        <p class="font-mono text-sm text-ink-soft">
          Sin ventana de chat que atender. Acciones chicas dentro de tu flujo — con modelos eficientes y uso justo generoso incluido cada mes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 font-mono text-xs">
        <div class="border-3 border-ink p-5 bg-bg-card shadow-hard space-y-3 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-hard-lg transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-lg bg-accent-yellow border-2 border-ink p-1">🧠</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase bg-ink text-bg-primary px-2 py-0.5">Pro</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-black text-base uppercase">Auto-summary</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">Guardás un repo o una herramienta. HeapDeck escribe qué es, cuándo usarlo y qué stack toca — solo, en background.</p>
          <p class="text-[11px] bg-bg-elevated border border-ink/20 p-2 italic">"fzf → buscador difuso para terminal. Úsalo para historial, archivos, procesos."</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-3 border-ink p-5 bg-bg-card shadow-hard space-y-3 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-hard-lg transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-lg bg-accent-pink border-2 border-ink p-1">🏷️</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase bg-ink text-bg-primary px-2 py-0.5">Pro</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-black text-base uppercase">Auto-tagging</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">Tipo, stack, propósito y nivel sugeridos al capturar. Vos confirmás o editás. Menos trabajo manual, más contexto útil.</p>
          <p class="text-[11px] bg-bg-elevated border border-ink/20 p-2 italic">Sugeridos: go · cli · imágenes · backend</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-3 border-ink p-5 bg-bg-card shadow-hard space-y-3 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-hard-lg transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-lg bg-accent-cyan border-2 border-ink p-1">🔍</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase bg-ink text-bg-primary px-2 py-0.5">Pro</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-black text-base uppercase">Búsqueda semántica</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">Buscá tu vault por intención, no por títulos exactos. Híbrido fuzzy + vectores sobre títulos, notas, READMEs y tu "por qué lo guardé".</p>
          <p class="text-[11px] bg-bg-elevated border border-ink/20 p-2 italic">"herramientas para agents en terminal"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-3 border-ink p-5 bg-bg-card shadow-hard space-y-3 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-hard-lg transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-lg bg-accent-lime border-2 border-ink p-1">🌐</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase bg-ink text-bg-primary px-2 py-0.5">Pro</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-black text-base uppercase">Descubrimiento por necesidad</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">Describí la necesidad, recibí repos de GitHub rankeados: stars, mantenimiento, señales del README. Guardalos con un click.</p>
          <p class="text-[11px] bg-bg-elevated border border-ink/20 p-2 italic">"CLI liviano en Go para redimensionar imágenes"</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-3 border-ink p-5 bg-bg-card shadow-hard space-y-3 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-hard-lg transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-lg bg-accent-orange border-2 border-ink p-1">✨</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase bg-ink text-bg-primary px-2 py-0.5">Pro</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-black text-base uppercase">Contenido → Conocimiento</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">Pegá una URL, README o texto. Obtené resumen, tags, comandos detectados, prerrequisitos. Guardalo como cheatsheet, item o runbook.</p>
          <p class="text-[11px] bg-bg-elevated border border-ink/20 p-2 italic">Contenido bruto → conocimiento accionable.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-3 border-ink p-5 bg-bg-card shadow-hard space-y-3 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-hard-lg transition-all">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
            <span class="text-lg bg-accent-lavender border-2 border-ink p-1">🔗</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase bg-ink text-bg-primary px-2 py-0.5">Pro</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-black text-base uppercase">Relacionados + joyas olvidadas</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-soft leading-relaxed">En cada item: repos similares, cheatsheets relacionadas, comandos del mismo stack. Más un resumen de gemas que no abrís hace 30+ días.</p>
          <p class="text-[11px] bg-bg-elevated border border-ink/20 p-2 italic">Tu vault se interconecta solo.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- AI search in action -->
      <div class="bg-ink border-3 border-ink shadow-hard-xl p-6 md:p-8 font-mono text-xs space-y-6">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b-2 border-dashed border-bg-primary/30 pb-3">
          <span class="font-black uppercase text-sm text-bg-primary">La búsqueda IA en acción</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase bg-accent-yellow text-ink font-black px-2 py-0.5 border border-bg-primary/30">Ejemplo ilustrativo</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="bg-bg-primary border-2 border-bg-primary/20 p-4 space-y-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-ink-soft">Tu vault · semántico</div>
            <p class="text-ink italic">"ese CLI en Go para optimizar imágenes"</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-ink-soft text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
              <li class="border-l-4 border-accent-lime pl-2"><span class="font-bold text-ink">h2non/bimg</span> — redimensionado de imágenes en Go con libvips. Guardado para thumbnails de API.</li>
              <li class="border-l-4 border-accent-yellow pl-2"><span class="font-bold text-ink">Cheatsheet ImageMagick</span> — one-liners mogrify para resize en lote.</li>
              <li class="border-l-4 border-accent-pink pl-2"><span class="font-bold text-ink">squoosh-cli</span> — compresión rápida por CLI antes de subir.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-bg-primary border-2 border-bg-primary/20 p-4 space-y-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase text-ink-soft">GitHub · descubrimiento por necesidad</div>
            <p class="text-ink italic">"CLI liviano en Go para redimensionar imágenes"</p>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-ink-soft text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
              <li class="border-l-4 border-accent-cyan pl-2"><span class="font-bold text-ink">disintegration/imaging</span> ★ 4.2k · mantenido · "imaging simple en Go, resize/blur/rotate". <span class="bg-accent-lime/40 px-1 border border-ink/20 font-bold text-ink">[+ Guardar]</span></li>
              <li class="border-l-4 border-accent-cyan pl-2"><span class="font-bold text-ink">h2non/bimg</span> ★ 3.1k · mantenido · "chico, rápido, bindings libvips". <span class="bg-accent-lime/40 px-1 border border-ink/20 font-bold text-ink">[+ Guardar]</span></li>
              <li class="border-l-4 border-accent-cyan pl-2"><span class="font-bold text-ink">anthonynsimon/bild</span> ★ 1.8k · estable · "procesamiento de imágenes en Go puro". <span class="bg-accent-lime/40 px-1 border border-ink/20 font-bold text-ink">[+ Guardar]</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- No-chat callout -->
      <div class="border-3 border-ink bg-accent-yellow p-6 shadow-hard flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 items-start md:items-center">
        <span class="text-2xl bg-bg-card border-2 border-ink p-2 shadow-hard-sm shrink-0">🚫💬</span>
        <div class="font-mono text-sm space-y-1">
          <p class="font-black uppercase font-display text-lg">¿Por qué sin chat? Porque chat hay en todos lados.</p>
          <p class="text-ink-soft text-xs leading-relaxed">HeapDeck Pro pone la IA donde pasa el recuerdo: capturar, buscar, reutilizar. Un click, sin prompts. Seguimos sumando acciones puntuales que ahorran minutos reales — y las listamos todas acá.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pricing Section -->
